~ start
if has_item("rock")
	=> carrying_rock
else
	=> empty_handed

~ empty_handed
Colossus: ...

Colossus: You are small to be standing here.
- Player: What are you doing here?
	Colossus: ...
- Player: Can you hear me?
	Colossus: ...
- Player: Goodbye.
	Colossus: ...

=> END

~ carrying_rock
Colossus: You brought a stone.

- Player: I found this on the ground.
	Colossus: It remembers the place you took it from.
- Player: Will you take it?
	Colossus: No. Carry it a little further. I have no need for it.
- Player: Goodbye.
	Colossus: ...

=> END
